# NZ: original UDP 500/4500 GeoIP compatibility rules, moved without changing content.
# Load only after ALL country domain, fixed-CIDR and DNS-IP mapping rules.
# Broad compatibility match; also includes non-VoWiFi IKE/IPsec traffic in this GeoIP country.
AND,((PROTOCOL,UDP),(DEST-PORT,500),(GEOIP,NZ))
AND,((PROTOCOL,UDP),(DEST-PORT,4500),(GEOIP,NZ))
